# Findings the Security workflow's image scan (Trivy) deliberately accepts.
# Every entry needs a reason; remove it once the cause is gone.

# jquery 2.2.4 (view/asset/jquery, composer "npm-asset/jquery": "^2.0"):
# with an unset dataType, a cross-domain $.ajax() response is executed as
# script. Frio and the larpnet theme only call same-origin endpoints, and
# moving to jQuery 3 is a frontend migration upstream Friendica hasn't done
# either. Revisit when upgrading jQuery.
NSWG-ECO-328
